description:
Export three functions that operate on JavaScript `Set` objects:
- `union(a, b)` — all elements from both sets
- `intersection(a, b)` — only elements in both sets
- `difference(a, b)` — elements in `a` but not in `b`

**Example:**
```js
union(new Set([1,2]), new Set([2,3]));        // Set {1, 2, 3}
intersection(new Set([1,2]), new Set([2,3])); // Set {2}
difference(new Set([1,2]), new Set([2,3]));   // Set {1}
```

